    <bpmn:process id="W_W4013" name="W4013. Worker Grievance Mechanism &amp; Remediation (Supply-Chain Level)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Worker grievance via channel; allegation/media/NGO report
Frequency: On event + maintained channels
Volume: Supply-chain workforce (tier-1+)
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / Compliance
Participants: Sustainability, Compliance (links to VS-119), Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-122), Legal, external grievance-channel providers, affected workers
Source: workflow W4013 — Worker Grievance Mechanism &amp; Remediation (Supply-Chain Level)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4013_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4013_Lane1" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4013_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4013_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4013_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4013_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4013_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4013_Start3" name="Worker grievance via channel; allegation/media/NGO report">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4013_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4013_Task4" name="Sustainability/Compliance operate accessible supply-chain grievance channels…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability/Compliance operate accessible supply-chain grievance channels (hotline, app, worker-committee) for workers in BuildRight&#x27;s supply chain, ensuring accessibility (language, literacy), confidentiality, and non-retaliation — distinct from BuildRight&#x27;s own speak-up (VS-119)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Compliance / channel provider
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Maintained + on event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4013_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4013_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4013_Task5" name="Sustainability triage, investigate (with supplier cooperation), and verify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sustainability triage, investigate (with supplier cooperation), and verify grievances; coordinate with audits (W4010/W4011) and CAPs (W4012)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Procurement
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Per grievance</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4013_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4013_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4013_Task6" name="Sustainability provide remedy, monitor for retaliation, and report aggregated…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability provide remedy, monitor for retaliation, and report aggregated grievance data (W4020); engage stakeholders where systemic (W4021)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Compliance
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Per grievance + aggregated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4013_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4013_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4013_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
