    <bpmn:process id="W_W4015" name="W4015. Conflict Minerals, Responsible Materials &amp; Smelter Due Diligence" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Saliency (W4002); tools/electronics/appliance sourcing
Frequency: Annual + on sourcing change
Volume: Mineral-intensive categories (tools, power tools, electronics, appliances)
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain
Participants: Sustainability, Procurement/Global Sourcing (links to VS-03/VS-122), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Insights, external mineral-DD providers, Legal
Source: workflow W4015 — Conflict Minerals, Responsible Materials &amp; Smelter Due Diligence</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4015_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4015_Lane1" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4015_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4015_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4015_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4015_Lane2" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4015_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4015_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4015_Start4" name="Saliency (W4002); tools/electronics/appliance sourcing">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4015_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4015_Task5" name="Sustainability/Procurement scope mineral exposure in BuildRight&#x27;s assortment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability/Procurement scope mineral exposure in BuildRight&#x27;s assortment (3TG — tin/tungsten/tantalum/gold — and cobalt/mica in tools/electronics/appliances/PPE) and apply the OECD Due Diligence Guidance for Responsible Supply Chains of Minerals from Conflict-Affected and High-Risk Areas
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Procurement
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4015_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4015_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4015_Task6" name="Procurement require smelter/refiner identification (CMRT/EMRT), prefer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procurement require smelter/refiner identification (CMRT/EMRT), prefer responsibly-assured smelters (RMAP), and trace to origin where feasible; integrate with global sourcing (links to VS-122.2) and the broader responsible-materials program
Responsible (R): Procurement / Global Sourcing / Sustainability
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per category</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4015_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4015_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4015_Task7" name="Sustainability report on minerals DD (links to W4020), engage stakeholders…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability report on minerals DD (links to W4020), engage stakeholders (W4021), and refresh on sourcing change; coordinate with sanctions (links to VS-86) and anti-counterfeit (links to VS-71)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Procurement
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4015_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4015_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4015_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
