        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-624 (ensure controlled execution — Supply Chain Human Rights Risk Assessment, Auditing &amp; Remediation (PA-131.2).) | - operational: smelter identification and RMAP; operational: a single CMRT/EMRT process
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
